{"title":"검신광룡","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bCuuwc/hAJjMhg93Y/OOPZr4ID03GhgiNqIYj3S1&filename=th3","synopsis":"'그러니 부탁함세…, 부디 내 손녀 딸을….'\n\n무림인들에겐 검재(劍災), 혹은 검괴(劍怪)라 불리고 백성들에겐 검선(劍仙).\n약 삼십 년 전, 돌연 자취를 감췄던 무당파 사상 최강 최악의 괴물이던 정현은 천마가 죽은 뒤 자취를 감춘다.\n\n그리고 얼마나 시간이 흘렀을까, 정현은 반로회동을 한 채 웬 여자아이 하나를 데리고 다시 강호에 모습을 드러낸다.\n자신 인생의 유일한 호적수이자 친우였던 천마의 손녀, 소진을 데리고 무당산으로 가는 여로에 오른 정현.\n\n두 사람의 여로는 무사히 마무리가 될 수 있을까?","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":127,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":136,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":132,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":143,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":136,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":107,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":106,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":115,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":82,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":101,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":129,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":131,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":141,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":116,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":235,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":166,"change":{"type":"up","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","a